<title>UK: DG Hyp sets 250 mln mark FRN due 2000. [CORRECTED 14:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>DG Hyp sets 250 mln mark FRN due 2000. [CORRECTED 14:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects abbreviation in headline to &quot;DG Hyp&quot;, from &quot;DG Bank&quot;)</p>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE GENOSSENSCHAFTS HYPOTEKENBANK (DG HYP)</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    27.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/16     PAY DATE   L11.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  15 BP     ISS PRICE  100.04    L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
